D3D12 only a _single_ time, the whole screen was a flashbang. Sounds like uninitialized memory?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4613896169/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4614017243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119688#issuecomment-4614017243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119688","id":4614017243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEwRQ2w","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T15:26:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T15:26:39Z","body":"> I think I managed to replicate this on D3D12 only a _single_ time, the whole screen was a flashbang. Sounds like uninitialized memory?\n\nYa, we only clear the LIGHT_X_ENABLED flag between frames when the light count decreases. \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c96e11965f1568343c65d783833250a6a9411cb2/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/environment/sky.cpp#L1111-L1117\n\nSince the expected usage is  to check if a light is enabled before accessing its memory\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c96e11965f1568343c65d783833250a6a9411cb2/scene/resources/3d/sky_material.cpp#L330-L339\n\nI believe the buffer is zero-initialized to begin with. But if not, that might be all that is needed. I think stale values are acceptable. Its also a pretty small buffer, so we could memzero it each frame if we wanted to","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4614017243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4614067410","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119688#issuecomment-4614067410","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119688","id":4614067410,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEwUU0g","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https: